            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.71

- Fixes a crash when the same Claude Code session has transcript files in both a project and a worktree. CodexMate now uses the most recently modified copy for the session's status, preview, and notifications.
- Prevents duplicate Claude sessions from taking up multiple places in Recent, and follows the latest transcript when you resume a different copy.
]]></description>
